# Never send host-built artefacts into the Docker build context — every service Dockerfile
# does `COPY apps/<service>/ ./apps/<service>/` (and some also `COPY packages/`), and without
# this file the host's node_modules (containing absolute-path symlinks into the host filesystem)
# overwrites the symlinks the container just built via `pnpm install`, breaking module resolution
# (e.g. `tsc --build` failing with "Cannot find module '.../typescript/bin/tsc'").
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.next
**/.next
coverage
**/coverage
.turbo
**/.turbo
*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.env
**/.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
.superpowers
